# Engineering

- TDD: write the failing Vitest first, then the code, then run `npm test`.
- Comments in English. UI copy and OpenSpec artifacts in Russian.
- Geometry stays in pure functions (`src/geometry/`). React components do not compute glare.
- v1 is a static SPA: no backend, database, accounts, or secrets.
- LED strip is an extended source (width > 0), never a single point.
- Commit only when the user explicitly asks. Never add Cursor attribution trailers.
- Push only after tests pass, and only when the user asks.
